<title>UK: IBCA affirms Bankers Trust NY Corp ratings.</title>
<headline>IBCA affirms Bankers Trust NY Corp ratings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following the announcement of the merger of Bankers Trust and Alex. Brown Incorporated, IBCA, the European credit rating agency, has affirmed the rating of Bankers Trust NY Corp at Long-term A plus and Short-term A1, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 6137</p>
</text>
